================================================================================
NOTE ON DATA LICENSING (applies to this repository)
================================================================================

The code in this repository is licensed under Apache-2.0 as above.

The connectome data this project consumes is NOT included in this repository and
is NOT covered by the Apache-2.0 grant. It is downloaded at runtime by scripts
in `clfly/connectome/fetch.py` from its original distributors, and carries its
own terms:

  * FlyWire (FAFB v783) connectivity and neuron annotations -- produced by the
    FlyWire Consortium. Distributed under CC BY-NC 4.0 (non-commercial).
    Cite Dorkenwald et al., Nature (2024) and Schlegel et al., Nature (2024).
    Redistributed here only as download instructions, never as files.

  * `philshiu/Drosophila_brain_model` -- MIT licensed code; the connectivity
    parquet it ships is FlyWire-derived and inherits the above terms.

If you use this repository's code or results in academic work, cite the
connectome papers above alongside the software citation in CITATION.cff.
